# pnpm 11 reads ONLY auth and registry settings from .npmrc. Everything that shapes
# node_modules (nodeLinker, shamefullyHoist, virtualStoreDir, ...) is configured in
# pnpm-workspace.yaml instead -- see the nodeLinker entry there.
#
# `node-linker=hoisted` and `shamefully-hoist=true` used to sit in this file. They
# were inert (pnpm 11 ignores non-auth keys here), which was misread as "pnpm 11
# dropped these settings" and as a reason the project could not be built locally.
# They are deleted rather than left in place so nobody mistakes them for a fix.
#
# This file intentionally configures nothing.
